<title>USA: Sodak in Brazilian joint venture.</title>
<headline>Sodak in Brazilian joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, R.I. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sodak Gaming Inc said it formed a joint venture with International Game Technology and GTECH Holdings Corp to develop and supply video gaming opportunities in Brazil.</p>
<p>Under the pact, the three companies will conduct business through a Brazilian limitada and will share equally in the expenses, profits, and investment funding of the joint venture, Sodak said.</p>
<p>The venture plans to implement linked video gaming system for the Confederacao Brasileira de Futebol (CBF or Brazilian Soccer Federation) and then a progressive prize structure, pending regulatory approval.</p>
</text>
